  "type": "history",
  "slug": "cover-shoot-for-sgt-pepper",
  "title": "30 March 1967: Cover shoot for Sgt Pepper",
  "date": "1967-03-30",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>Prior to a late night recording session at Abbey Road, The Beatles visited Michael Cooper’s London photographic studio where the cover photographs for <a href=\"/albums/sgt-peppers-lonely-hearts-club-band/\">Sgt Pepper’s Lonely Hearts Club Band</a> were taken. <span id=\"more-2888\"></span></p><p><a href=\"/gallery/alternative-images/alternative-sgt-pepper-full/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-9078\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"sync\" data-attachment-id=\"9078\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/alternative-images/alternative-sgt-pepper-full/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-sgt-pepper-full.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"400,322\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The full photograph used for the cover of Sgt Pepper&amp;#8217;s Lonely Hearts Club Band\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-sgt-pepper-full.jpg\" src=\"/wp/media/alternative-sgt-pepper-full.jpg\" alt=\"The full photograph used for the cover of Sgt Pepper's Lonely Hearts Club Band\" width=\"400\" height=\"322\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-9078\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-sgt-pepper-full.jpg 400w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-sgt-pepper-full-200x161.jpg 200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px\"></a></p><p>The shoot took place at 4 Chelsea Manor Studios, 1-11 Flood Street, just off King’s Road in Chelsea. The studios opened in 1902, and Cooper established his studio from 22 July 1966.</p><p>The Beatles arrived in the late afternoon. The soon-to-be-famous collage, designed by Peter Blake and his wife Jann Haworth, had been assembled in the studio during the preceding eight days.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1967/03/30/cover-shoot-for-sgt-pepper/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-2888 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_01/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTM3IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEzNyI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"137\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_01-200x137.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles during the Sgt Pepper cover shoot, 30 March 1967\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_01-200x137.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_01-580x396.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_01-960x655.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_01-768x524.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_01.jpg 1194w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"28523\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1194,815\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles during the Sgt Pepper cover shoot, 30 March 1967\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_01-960x655.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_02/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTM5IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEzOSI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"139\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_02-200x139.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles during the Sgt Pepper cover shoot, 30 March 1967\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_02-200x139.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_02-580x402.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_02-960x665.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_02-768x532.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_02.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"28524\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_02/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_02.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,693\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles during the Sgt Pepper cover shoot, 30 March 1967\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_02-960x665.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_03/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxMzQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTM0IDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"134\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_03-134x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles during the Sgt Pepper cover shoot, 30 March 1967\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_03-134x200.jpg 134w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_03-388x580.jpg 388w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_03-643x960.jpg 643w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_03-768x1147.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_03.jpg 984w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 134px) 100vw, 134px\" data-attachment-id=\"28525\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_03/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_03.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"984,1470\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles during the Sgt Pepper cover shoot, 30 March 1967\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_03-643x960.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_04/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxMzMiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTMzIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"133\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_04-133x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Ringo Starr, Mal Evans and John Lennon during the Sgt Pepper cover shoot, 30 March 1967\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_04-133x200.jpg 133w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_04-386x580.jpg 386w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_04-639x960.jpg 639w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_04-768x1154.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_04-1023x1536.jpg 1023w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_04-1363x2048.jpg 1363w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_04.jpg 1366w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 133px) 100vw, 133px\" data-attachment-id=\"28526\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_04/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_04.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1366,2052\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-comments-count=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Ringo Starr, Mal Evans and John Lennon during the Sgt Pepper cover shoot, 30 March 1967\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_04-639x960.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_05/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTMzIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEzMyI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"133\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_05-200x133.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Mal Evans, Paul McCartney and Michael Cooper during the Sgt Pepper cover shoot, 30 March 1967\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_05-200x133.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_05-580x387.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_05-960x640.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_05-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_05.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"28527\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_05/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_05.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,667\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Mal Evans, Paul McCartney and Michael Cooper during the Sgt Pepper cover shoot, 30 March 1967\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670330-beatles-sgt-pepper-shoot_05-960x640.jpg\"></a></div></figure></div><p>A contract dated 14 April 1967 described the various fees for the session, including a misspelling of the album title:</p><blockquote><div>Hire and use of Michael Cooper Studios for 8 days including personnel (3 fulltime assistants) plus overtime and expenses to staff for additional work during Easter weekend: £625.0.0<p></p><p>54 copy negatives @ 10/6 each: 28.7.0</p><p>54 20″x16″ prints @ 17/6 each: 47.5.0</p><p>Photography fee (SGT. PEPPER’S LONELY HEARTS BAND set and centre spread, closeup): 250.0.0</p><p>Art direction fee (Layout and co-ordination of sleeve and inserts, cutouts, song sheets, production of mechanical rough and artwork by Al Vandenberg for Michael Cooper Studios, including co-ordination and supervision of all aspects of design and artwork from Peter Blake and Simon &amp; Marekka; supervision and co-ordination of printing, retouching and blockmaking): £350.0.0</p><p>Special fee to Peter Blake: £200.0.0</p></div></blockquote><p>In addition to the front cover shot, The Beatles also posed for the images used on the back cover and the gatefold sleeve.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1967/03/30/cover-shoot-for-sgt-pepper/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-2\" class=\"gallery galleryid-2888 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_03/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTMyIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEzMiI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"132\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_03-200x132.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles in Sgt Pepper uniforms, 1967\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_03-200x132.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_03-580x382.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_03-960x632.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_03-768x506.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_03.jpg 1280w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"28021\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_03/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_03.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1280,843\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles in Sgt Pepper uniforms, 1967\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_03-960x632.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_02/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTM2IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEzNiI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"136\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_02-200x136.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles in Sgt Pepper uniforms, 1967\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_02-200x136.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_02-580x394.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_02-960x653.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_02-768x522.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_02.jpg 1024w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"28020\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_02/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_02.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1024,696\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles in Sgt Pepper uniforms, 1967\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_02-960x653.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_01/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"100\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_01-200x100.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles in Sgt Pepper uniforms, 1967\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_01-200x100.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_01-580x290.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_01-960x480.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_01-768x384.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_01-1536x769.jpg 1536w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_01-2048x1025.jpg 2048w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"28019\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_01-scaled.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"2560,1281\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles in Sgt Pepper uniforms, 1967\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-sgt-pepper-gatefold_01-960x480.jpg\"></a></div></figure></div><p>The cover had come about after <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/\">Paul McCartney</a> came up with the album title. He took some ideas to his art dealer friend Robert Fraser, who suggested they use Blake, Haworth and Cooper to realise the concept.</p><blockquote><div>We had an original meeting with all four Beatles, Robert Fraser and <a href=\"/people/brian-epstein/\">Brian Epstein</a>; most of the subsequent talking was done with Paul at his house and with <a href=\"/people/john-lennon/\">John</a> there sometimes.</div></blockquote><div class=\"source\">Peter Blake</div><p>McCartney’s initial idea was to stage a presentation featuring a mayor and a corporation, with a floral clock and a selection of photographs of famous faces on the wall behind The Beatles.</p><p>He asked the others to list their choices for the photographs; the original list, complete with misspellings, was given to Fraser and Blake:</p><blockquote><div>Yoga’s; Marquis de Sade; Hitler; Neitch; Lenny Bruce; Lord Buckley; Alistair Crowley; Dylan Thomas; James Joyce; Oscar Wilde; William Burroughs; Robert Peel; Stockhausen; Auldus Huxley; H.G. Wells; Izis Bon; Einstein; Carl Jung; Beardsley; Alfred Jarry; Tom Mix; Johnny Weissmuller; Magritte; Tyrone Power; Carl Marx; Richard Crompton; Tommy Hanley; Albert Stubbins; Fred Astaire.</div></blockquote><p>McCartney took the list and sketches to Peter Blake, who developed the concept further. Further names were added and others fell by the wayside.</p><p>Jesus and Hitler were among John Lennon’s choices, but they were left off the final list. Gandhi, meanwhile, was disallowed by Sir Joseph Lockwood, the head of EMI, after he told them they would have problems having the sleeve printed in India.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1967/03/30/cover-shoot-for-sgt-pepper/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-3\" class=\"gallery galleryid-2888 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/alternative-images/alternative-sgt-pepper_01/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxOTgiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTk4IDIwMCI+